        "Day surgery suits short operations with little blood loss in ASA I–II patients who have a responsible adult to take them home and stay 24 hours, a telephone, transport and a home within reach of help; the pre-assessment clinic prepares the fasting, medicines, consent, escort and expectations, and a call the day before prevents cancellations.",
